        "evap_at": {
          "params": [
            "kz"
          ],
          "description": "Evaporation applied in layer kz, negative or zero: the Kessler rate limited by the humidity bound and by the water available. A TEMPLATE rather than an array because the evaporation sweep needs it at the cell it has just published; as an observed it closes a cycle with the total flux that esm-spec 4.9.6 rejects, even though every read is of a published cell. Re-applied afterwards to the finished profile so it can be asserted.",
